# Fixture URI is a local file; transport and human AT remain separate gates.
settle 30
key escape
open ${TURNSTONE_A11Y_MICRON_URI}
settle 60
act Toggle live content
settle 30
assert content-live
assert a11y link: First Micron >> link: Second Micron
capture micron_document_a11y
# The inline field is inert source text. The host's real editor owns editing.
act Fill Micron form
assert a11y textinput: name = seed
assert a11y Enter to continue
key enter
assert a11y passwordinput: secret
key enter
assert a11y type send and press Enter
capture micron_host_form_confirmation
# Deliberately stop before network submission; the unit gate checks the exact
# SubmitMicron effect and existing transport gates own request delivery.
key escape
